  "notes": "连接与断开更可靠\n\n- 断开连接时正确处理正在结束的后台请求，避免已关闭的连接被误报为断开失败；其他清理故障仍会明确报告。\n- 无法确认网卡、路由或系统代理时显示待检测，不凭未知结果自动重连或判断连接正常。\n- TUN 模式准确提示第三方系统代理冲突，帮助识别被其他代理接管的连接。\n- 直连模式只检查所需连接路径；手动复测和诊断日志与当前模式保持一致。\n- iOS 连接状态和基础网络检测不再把登录门户、重定向或错误页面视为检测通过。\n",
  "notesEn": "More reliable connection checks and disconnects\n\n- Disconnecting handles background requests that are already ending, so a closed connection does not appear as a disconnect failure. Other cleanup failures are still reported.\n- Checks show a pending status when the network adapter, route or system proxy cannot be confirmed. An unknown result does not trigger an automatic reconnect or certify the connection as healthy.\n- TUN mode reports conflicts with a system proxy enabled by another app, helping identify connections taken over by another proxy.\n- Direct mode checks only the required connection path. Manual retests and diagnostic logs follow the current mode.\n- iOS connection checks and basic network tests no longer report a sign-in portal, redirect or error page as a passed check.\n",
